{"title": "Arcane Enchantment (+1)", "pageid": 27962, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Arcane_Enchantment_(+1)", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Enchantment_(%2B2)\" title=\"Arcane Enchantment (+2)\">Arcane Enchantment (+2)</a>        </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Arcane Enchantment</b> is a passive feature that boosts a caster's spellcasting ability.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You gain a +1 bonus to <a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Save_DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spell Save DC\">Spell Save DC</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Attack\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spell Attack\">Spell Attack</a> rolls. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Caitiff_Staff\" title=\"Caitiff Staff\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Quarterstaff_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Quarterstaff_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Quarterstaff_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Quarterstaff_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Quarterstaff_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Quarterstaff_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Quarterstaff_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Quarterstaff_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a hre